PETSELFTEST1
# V6-02 rest: PAGE_PREV, GO_HOME, PET_FEED, PET_GROOM and OPEN_GAME as
# "vcmd" steps (the names self.pet.request passes on; XiaoZhi is idle here,
# so nothing is deferred). Counted from "mark begin".
# Needs: outside the quiet hours ("phase day" pins the day phase) and a
# battery above the low level.
# expect min:name=PAGE_PREV 2
# expect min:name=GO_HOME 4
# expect min:name=PET_FEED 1
# expect min:name=PET_GROOM 1
# expect min:name=OPEN_GAME 1
# At home there is no page to turn back, and home is home already.
# expect min:result=not_in_reader 1
# expect min:result=already 1
# Reader, food picker, brushing, game menu, and home from each of them.
# expect min:result=done 7
# Feed opens the food picker and groom the brushing: voice feeds nothing,
# the dial would (left with a long press here, so no meal, no record).
# expect min:kind=feed 1
# expect min:kind=brush 1
# expect min:PET_GAME_MENU 1
# expect none:PET_CARE_RECORD 0
# expect none:result=deferred 0
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_REQUESTED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
phase day
volume 15
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Home: no book to turn back; already home.
vcmd PAGE_PREV
wait 2000
vcmd GO_HOME
wait 2000
# Reader (or its no-book picture): next, previous, then home by voice.
vcmd OPEN_READER
wait 7000
vcmd PAGE_NEXT
wait 4000
vcmd PAGE_PREV
wait 4000
vcmd GO_HOME
wait 6000
# Food picker opened by voice, left with the dial's long press (no meal).
vcmd PET_FEED
wait 6000
hold press 1500 6000
# Brushing opened by voice, home by voice.
vcmd PET_GROOM
wait 6000
vcmd GO_HOME
wait 6000
# Game menu opened by voice, home by voice.
vcmd OPEN_GAME
wait 6000
vcmd GO_HOME
wait 6000
end
